      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……わかりました。\r\nあなた方が来たのも、きっと\r\n偶然ではないのでしょう。",
        "official_en": "...Very well. Perhaps it was fate that brought you here.",
        "real_en": "...Very well. I doubt your coming here was a coincidence."
