      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "それはあなた方の手に負えるものではありません。\r\n今はおとなしくしていることです。",
        "official_en": "One that you are ill-suited to face. I suggest you concern yourselves with it no longer.",
        "real_en": "This is beyond your power to handle. For now, you should stay out of it."
      },
